      "statement": "MHFC's Standardized CET1 requirement of 10.2% is the sum of the 4.5% regulatory minimum, a 3.2% stress capital buffer (effective October 1, 2025), and a 2.5% G-SIB surcharge, with the countercyclical buffer at 0%; the Q2 2026 supplement and the capital planning model use the same additive stack.",
