      "statement": "The Pillar 3 report defines the Standardized capital conservation buffer requirement as SCB (3.2%) plus G-SIB surcharge (2.5%) plus countercyclical buffer (0%), giving the 5.7% required, whereas under the Advanced approaches the buffer is 2.5% plus the G-SIB surcharge and countercyclical buffer; the same table lists CET1, Tier 1 and Total capital requirements of 10.2%, 11.7% and 13.7%.",
